WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Kneel and sit back toward the heels, knees together or wide.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Fold forward and rest the forehead on the floor or a block.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Extend the arms forward or rest them alongside the body.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Soften completely and breathe slowly.
